<title>UK: UBS names Flemings' Sullivan chemicals head.</title>
<headline>UBS names Flemings' Sullivan chemicals head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland unit UBS Ltd said on Thursday Robert Fleming &amp; Co Ltd director Mark Sullivan is to become managing director and joint head of its chemicals group.</p>
<p>It said in a statement Sullivan would run the sector jointly with Alan Norris, supported by the bank's existing corporate finance and equity research teams in Zurich and London.</p>
<p>Sullivan is head of chemicals investment banking at Flemings. UBS said the appointment gave it &quot;significant additional capability&quot; in one of its core sectors.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
